meta {
  name: 02 Who am I now?
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/api/me
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{jwt}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.role: eq AGENT
  res.body.email: isDefined
  res.body.userId: isDefined
}

docs {
  Sanity check. The JWT from registration should immediately work — I'm not
  going to log in twice just to be sure.

  What I want to see:
  - role = AGENT (not silently APPLICANT)
  - my full name back
  - no surprise extra steps before I can act

  Note: a real agent would expect to see the verification status here too.
  If it's only on /verifications/mine, that's two screens instead of one.
}
